     "id": "d86e2167-6311-4158-b376-7fbb495ac647"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Which site-1 covectors are reached — as linear algebra\n\n`Solve` returns several branches and `Last` picks a degenerate one, so do it directly: the 8 SoV\ncovectors with the minimal site-2 label span an 8-dim space; ask which combinations kill the 16\ncomponents that are not of the form (site-1 slot) x `(0,0,1)`.\n\nDone both at a random rational point and **symbolically in `h`, `θ[1]`, `θ[2]`, `z[i]`**.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "rows = Table[First[xx[μ1, {{0}, {0}}]], {μ1, gtpats[1]}];\ncolsBad = Select[Range[24], Mod[#, 3] != 0 &];    (* not of the form  slot x (0,0,1) *)\ncolsGood = Select[Range[24], Mod[#, 3] == 0 &];\nnsSym = NullSpace[Transpose[Together[rows[[All, colsBad]]]]];\nrrsSym = Together[nsSym . rows[[All, colsGood]]];\nGrid[{\n  {\"SoV covectors used (site-2 label minimal)\", Length[rows]},\n  {\"dim of localizing combinations\", Length[nsSym]},\n  {\"rank of the resulting site-1 covectors\", MatrixRank[rrsSym]},\n  {\"row-reduced span\", MatrixForm[Simplify[RowReduce[rrsSym]]]},\n  {\"=> slots reached\", {3, 5, 7, 8}}\n  }, Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
